  "name": "codeman",
  "description": "Drive Codeman, the session manager this agent is running inside, over its HTTP API, from any agent CLI (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, OpenCode, Antigravity, Grok Build, DeepSeek Harness, OMP): list sessions, start worker sessions in any installed CLI, send them prompts, block until they finish (wait / wait-output / send-and-wait), read their output, and clean up; where available, message claude workers directly (Claude Code cross-session messaging). Use when asked to orchestrate or parallelize work across Codeman sessions, get a second opinion from another CLI or model, hand work to the local model Codeman installed on this Mac (\"use the local model\"), watch another session, start and manage workers, or retrieve saved local Codex history by file/native ID or root and descendants with topic/date filters. Live API operations require a Codeman-managed session (CODEMAN_MUX=1). Offline history reads do not require a server or managed session.",
